# Sokka, Tenacious Tactician: "Other Allies you control have menace and prowess" and "Whenever YOU cast a noncreature spell". Bot2's
# Mox Pearl (a noncreature spell, turn 2) makes no Ally for Bot1, and Bot2's Expedition Envoy (a 2/1 Ally) gets neither menace nor
# prowess. On turn 3 Bot1's own Expedition Envoy has menace, and Bot1's Lightning Bolt pumps it (2/1 -> 3/2) as well as Sokka (4/4),
# while Bot2's Envoy stays 2/1. Bot1's Memnite (not an Ally) gets neither: no menace, and it stays 1/1 through the Bolt.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Sokka, Tenacious Tactician
Expedition Envoy
Lightning Bolt
Memnite
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Expedition Envoy
Island x18

